  "observations": [
    "All eight raw screenshots and eight red-box annotations were inspected",
    "Eight evenly sampled frames from each of four recordings were inspected, not every video frame",
    "Both revisions display a real generated response first and the Cached response badge after repeating the same prompt in a new chat",
