    "Phone submission used Enter in the message field, and the complete generated answer and cache badge remained visible",
    "Final screenshots were captured after chat-history toasts cleared, while recordings retain loading, streaming, model selection and transient toasts",
    "No password or token is visible in the inspected images and sampled frames, and the browser harness checks that the login password input is masked",
    "The dashboard is a compatibility check for this backend fix and shows no new visual behavior"
